<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Siderca Q4 net profit $24.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Siderca Q4 net profit $24.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth quarter ended March 31.</p>
<p>Net $24.3 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>Year ended March 31:</p>
<p>$175.2 million vs $32.4 million.</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said sales of its steel tubes rose to 784,826 tonnes vs 728,714 tonnes in the previous fiscal year.</p>
<p>It also said exports are expected to grow in the near future due to increasing activity in the energy sector.</p>
<p>((--David Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0652))</p>
</text>
